# The Go build reads the module files and the capabilities package. An
# allowlist keeps the operator's sources, the Rust crates, the docs, and
# the deploy manifests out of this build context, so a change to them
# does not rebuild this image.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!capabilities/
# go build never reads a test file, so a test-only edit does not rebuild this image.
**/*_test.go
